{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_title", "source_sha256": "bc8d6810f1ec116f59b4db71b48c6fc4dbb9e79ed25c95f9fcd7f38319de9424", "ja": "夢見る才能", "zh": "做梦的才能", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_synopsis", "source_sha256": "753985ebf6b9352c9427bcba40d6dccd2b93a8952cf1b318ab1e9f51566bdc93", "ja": "オーディションに落ち続け凹んでいる未来。\nライブ前のレッスンで、皆が大変そうだと\n振付の変更を提案する。だが朋花に、それは\n手加減だと注意される。未来は、挑戦する前\nから諦めていた、自分の誤りに気付く。", "zh": "试镜接连落选而备受打击的未来。\n在演唱会前的练习中，她觉得大家都很辛苦\n便提议修改动作。但朋花却提醒她，\n这是在放水。未来察觉到了自己的错误——\n自己在挑战之前就放弃了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c2929bef6a6292692dadcab69e660d5916f448d3169429b45bcbf0680e482b6d", "ja": "（定期公演のレッスンが始まった。メンバーは、\n未来、ロコ、亜利沙、朋花、それにあずささんだ）", "zh": "（定期公演的排练开始了。成员有未来、ROCO、亚利沙、朋花，以及梓小姐。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1001_p", "source_sha256": "33a62c6d01035d72a69d4fbea6153588d2e2e3cbdb149aaba71df187923f0c8e", "ja": "あずささんは、今日は仕事で参加できないんだ。\n俺も打ち合わせで出なきゃいけないけど……。", "zh": "今天梓小姐有工作，没法参加。\n我也得去开会，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9719c53541e3fe6b2e35a15de86c39b5ddf23c338fb17c3e440c2f6d14ce6f9f", "ja": "振り付けの先生によると、今回のダンスは難易度が\n高めらしい。みんな、しっかり頑張ろうな！", "zh": "听编舞老师说，这次的舞蹈难度似乎比较高。大家都好好加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1004_dancesensei", "source_sha256": "b811884f2a4f202bd13de3bc559164473e71bfa825c25005c3d60927eec75580", "ja": "ストップ！\n松田さん、ロコさん、遅れてる！　天空橋さんも！", "zh": "停下！\n松田小姐、ROCO小姐，落后了！天空桥小姐也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1005_dancesensei", "source_sha256": "1ab063768d3d27d0137e8c30897630944d47b25e88c764730051014276eec6bd", "ja": "少し難しいけど、ここが決まると決まらないじゃ\n全体の印象が全然違うの。頑張ってちょうだい！", "zh": "虽然有点难，但这里能不能做好，\n给人的整体印象可是完全不一样的哦。加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "4cdf426c11016bcf36aa3d52bedda8105a2b628163da1e38d75650958d536a82", "ja": "はいっ。", "zh": "好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "74f5c3c7c10c57771fd2a8a435be5b388e6ddd6693feb8a793fdd47bb012db32", "ja": "は、はいっ！", "zh": "好、好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "469afbf859b2ace5b574292019d6d8d68c4e2196d2831bf706a58735e8b8a1ba", "ja": "アンダースタンドです……！", "zh": "我明白了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1009_dancesensei", "source_sha256": "68542bbeb6550613eaed751d6e37209c2dcecdd884133786642f50a5a42893df", "ja": "それじゃ、今日はここまで。\nそれぞれの課題は、次回までに復習しておいてね！", "zh": "那么，今天就到这里。\n各自的课题要在下次之前复习好哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "78486bccf833b79526f4873d5040566d84764bac21557ec91e89cc5863c66a28", "ja": "はい！　お疲れさまでしたー！", "zh": "好的！辛苦了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1011_se", "source_sha256": "f9ab9c0e82198616dcb11b1dff7f8fccc121e11869006855284bd811ec05903e", "ja": "ガチャ、……バタン！", "zh": "咔嗒……砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "dea697c66bc7e89fe30b6ded8aec5edade9b29da68415b20e3ae9ec58cb3485c", "ja": "……ふぅ～。今日のレッスン、\n先生、すっごく厳しかったね……。", "zh": "……呼～。今天的练习，\n老师超级严厉呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "08d00128ba4e1e2113724099688fae7dabd47eb09dcbe12eb5dadaf0e723a5be", "ja": "新しい振り付け、難しかったですから……\nありさ、がんばらないと。", "zh": "毕竟新动作很难呢……\n亚利沙得加把劲才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "f13ab5098db7049ea9dd89418bf13abb4c2e9bb98928da816e008ef1dd384fac", "ja": "そうですね～。わかっていても、\n手と足がちっとも追いつきませんでしたから～。", "zh": "是啊～。虽然明白是怎么回事，可手脚完全跟不上呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "80764419289b8d4d0448d8a57b6a46b4301dd778c4c5ea3bcc0dfecd4105529d", "ja": "そっか……。だったら{$P$}さんに\n相談して、振り付けを変えてもらう？", "zh": "这样啊……那要不要去找{$P$}先生商量一下，请他把舞蹈动作改掉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "56d33f562fe1a92fddcdc9983014af6d195036dcb6ac364223eea501db1417d0", "ja": "えっ？　か、変えちゃうんですか？", "zh": "诶？要、要改掉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "192613de628cf4fb08349f60477bf4c338d9fd47d189094852eaf406ab38d66e", "ja": "うん！　だってこれ、全員が\nちゃんと揃ってたほうがカッコイイんだよね？", "zh": "嗯！因为这个还是所有人整整齐齐地统一起来更帅气，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "0b6a4c8ee6e127db12613c1e15d74f92e3996467285db4c5c699477a5ea960e9", "ja": "無理してバラバラになっちゃうくらいなら、\n簡単にしてもらったほうがいいかなって。", "zh": "与其勉强自己，结果反而变得七零八落，不如把难度调低一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "ef68e587b49c3df9f294779bb5d746e6bc1b151edd1d8bee44cdaf4a7d5db79e", "ja": "……。\n未来ちゃん。本当に、それでいいんですか～？", "zh": "……\n未来。真的这样就可以了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "280cd16ee66bd8d07137076ec9fd096dc7de69b71f772e6e65a67fac653e3d02", "ja": "みんなと仲良しなのは、悪いことではありませんが……\nそれは、手加減する理由にはなりませんよ～？", "zh": "和大家关系好并不是坏事，不过……\n那可不能成为手下留情的理由哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "7d0e0b9a75142248c88a1aa47a15bedd02602b1dd44c9d034a17bda471f2701d", "ja": "え！？　そ、そういうわけじゃないけど……！", "zh": "诶！？不、不是因为这个啦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "bc3f3d5260e72bd5191f193ff75f1fab2b9fcb9238e48cc22ada6b8415679e9c", "ja": "では、どんな理由なんですか～？", "zh": "那么，究竟是什么理由呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "cb34457603dab89541ac4cbadb6f10ae6cff7685a332655840d11ffd61946401", "ja": "え、えっと……。", "zh": "那个，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "5148ea926d16ae51ea0271c111c3da693edd8580175db5318696796fbcb55a83", "ja": "ま、待ってください、朋花ちゃん！\nありさ、がんばりますから大丈夫です！", "zh": "请、请等一下，朋花！\n亚利沙会加油的，所以没关系的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1026_025roc", "source_sha256": "043346798acbf969e619fb0db89f219e53a9fc4bd6c41a38aee695aee468ba26", "ja": "ロコも、ノープロブレムですよ！\n公演までには、できるようになりますから！", "zh": "ROCO也没问题哦！到公演之前就能做到的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "0d14eeeb6ff3d4e0f0d5a0390359beb6a107e972980eef370d18937a7d0cbd37", "ja": "ふたりとも……。", "zh": "你们两个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1028_031tom", "source_sha256": "02c731704e74b24dcfbcdbfb2f2ad0ed449e9cf1e8e75bf846331b36a19dcc48", "ja": "いいですか、未来ちゃん。私たちは誰のために\n公演をしているか……それを考えてくださいね～？", "zh": "可以吗，未来？我们究竟是在为谁\n演出……请好好想一想哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1030_p", "source_sha256": "e0632def8e7eeaa7896cefdc8d7226542d864f6793d9f108edbc024f0e17fdf3", "ja": "（予定より時間が掛かったな。レッスンはもう\n終わってるか……あ、あそこにいるのは）", "zh": "（比预想中花的时间更久。练习应该已经结束了吧……啊，那里的是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1031_p", "source_sha256": "1c627612c0edb1eec2dae351a708eb2d2b31998e3ae0ee1a3ed39ec311fa7e99", "ja": "あずささん、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "あずさ小姐，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1032_010azu", "source_sha256": "222a8c01d7ee64e70f7847f680df59b91ec620881926dc3013c4767eacb7665c", "ja": "まあ、{$P$}さん。\n今お帰りですか？", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生。\n您现在要回去了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1033_p", "source_sha256": "b029d12137fdf042ceedee4e87ab218962c3c08c6717ba5ca056adaeb18fedf2", "ja": "ええ。あずささんも？", "zh": "嗯。梓小姐也是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1034_010azu", "source_sha256": "25080384d516dd5854f67ea073c3f102e9040f3ea9436413f3178c54ea83959c", "ja": "はい。思ったより早く帰れたので、すこしだけでも\nレッスンして帰ろうかと……あら？", "zh": "嗯。因为比想象中更早回来了，所以想着哪怕只练习一会儿再回去……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1035_010azu", "source_sha256": "101fdac36cd107a2c6d6572e37b602b0cd091cb47dac36b8c2567d61f1e892f7", "ja": "あそこにいるのは、未来ちゃん……？", "zh": "在那里的是未来……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1036_p", "source_sha256": "b4c769999a5112c183acf51da188e07d63984a47cd1680caf647f316fe2a545a", "ja": "本当だ……レッスン着のままで、どうしたんだろう。\nおーい、未来！", "zh": "真的……还穿着练习服，她这是怎么了？\n喂——未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "d09e65be236f726a4f8066fe24909ad9e9cdf7d9467fe96c0934500963e14e65", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\nあずささんも……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。三浦梓小姐也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1039_p", "source_sha256": "6deaf65f09f8458e129f45b0b55da9e617c98ba02ff3f99e9f9da7c81e23329d", "ja": "そうか……朋花がそんな事を。", "zh": "这样啊……朋花居然做了那种事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1040_014mir", "source_sha256": "2637224c7e45fd2b24b86df9e613db65f352ebd74587589f499b90a09adaea2b", "ja": "はい……。\n私、朋花ちゃんのこと、怒らせちゃった……。", "zh": "是的……\n我把朋花惹生气了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "7e0e5d43b7e1cbf9219544544582c6bb102942901128b9fa86f6f029faa76f9f", "ja": "私、こんなんだから、オーディションも\n落ちてばっかりなのかな……。", "zh": "是不是因为我就是这样，才会一直在试镜中落选呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1042_p", "source_sha256": "4ff43f5b4cc302035311bfc0a976d30d68e51e60209a9f3c05282d8f367404e3", "ja": "オーディションの事は、また別の問題かな。\n未来は頑張っているけど、仕事には縁や運もあるから。", "zh": "试镜的事，或许又是另一个问题吧。\n未来虽然一直很努力，但工作也有缘分和运气的因素。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1043_010azu", "source_sha256": "b25e2eaf9d510a633f2678f8d4e1374e279932ec3e768ce12e0cb4534358e947", "ja": "そうよ、未来ちゃん。\n私だって、いつも上手くいくとは限らないもの。", "zh": "是啊，未来。\n就连我也不可能总是一帆风顺。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1044_010azu", "source_sha256": "47df0e9239af069fba77cfe58fc785d933738ba8d68524a1667c3842132df556", "ja": "私は、アイドルとして優等生というわけじゃないから。\n苦手なことだって、たくさんあるし……。", "zh": "我并不算是偶像中的优等生。也有很多不擅长的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1045_014mir", "source_sha256": "4acea40932685159299c4473ad9a4abce88a82e88421a0f94199ad35face5ae5", "ja": "えっ……。\nあずささん、そうなんですか？", "zh": "诶……\n秋月小姐，原来是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1046_010azu", "source_sha256": "3d0595d29e03bb1e4304d98bcec24bfc4114fd0383a5f00aaa6d90c543e6876c", "ja": "ええ。たくさん失敗して、悔しい思いをして……\nそうして、ひとつずつ経験を積んできたの。", "zh": "是的。经历过许多失败，也体会过不甘……就这样，一点一点积累了经验。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1047_010azu", "source_sha256": "81cce1e209c5748a8f8cf2d418e1e736133b87a9c0d0abd976259b633deb4c9b", "ja": "でも、そうね。\n私から未来ちゃんに、言えることがあるとしたら……。", "zh": "不过，你说得对。\n如果要说我有什么能告诉未来的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1048_010azu", "source_sha256": "0f3d9e7a0f1bf94b327667bf705e255b989070c17f5a02468a2d71fe83f50d6b", "ja": "もしそれが、絶対にできないことなら、\n公演のプログラムには入っていないと思うわ。", "zh": "如果那是绝对做不到的事情，应该就不会被安排进演出节目里了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1049_010azu", "source_sha256": "f32ba28a76de23239aac541129e1f925a90e396e86a63962cb578b9c80a7aeec", "ja": "そうですよね？　{$P$}さん。", "zh": "是吧？{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1050_p", "source_sha256": "0c788b7ccccbc372f440e8e14e83a16b7681ba05d103ca3fa5a4c57da36c0e85", "ja": "はい。亜利沙もロコも、ダンスは苦手ですが……\n最初の頃に比べれば、かなり上達しました。", "zh": "是的。虽然亚利沙和ROCO都不擅长跳舞……\n但和刚开始相比，已经进步很多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1051_p", "source_sha256": "85adc3ef0dfb4589ffab9726308214b055f5dcf5fce470573fdaeedb5393fb88", "ja": "今のふたりなら、できると思っての事です。", "zh": "我是觉得现在的她们俩，应该能够做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1053_014mir", "source_sha256": "7f0df0f47e70a59ef5270b953009dc6bedb8c547efd73c36f99ca4e5637f21e6", "ja": "私、{$P$}さんがそんなふうに\n考えてるなんて、思ってもみなかった……。", "zh": "我完全没想到，{$P$}先生居然是这么想的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1054_p", "source_sha256": "136a122f1688279d3582f59f50063e9ecf76b77617a1023dab2aed9d979f6e54", "ja": "言ってないんだから、わからなくても仕方がないよ。\nでも未来、ひとつ忘れてないか？", "zh": "我没说过，所以你不知道也没办法。不过未来，你有没有忘了一件事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1055_p", "source_sha256": "091f5c6ce41cf30b9ea134282c732431e0b2cbf4d3689c51126be7100f66ed3b", "ja": "亜利沙やロコだけじゃない。\n朋花だって、すごくダンスが得意なわけじゃないよな？", "zh": "不只是亚利沙和ROCO。朋花也不是特别擅长跳舞，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1057_p", "source_sha256": "156537f577300df76c6e6aa81d73abe3078f2f706fa47d265c2328c23b715bb0", "ja": "何でも自分を基準に考えてはいけないけど……朋花は\nきっと、ロコと亜利沙ならできると信じているんだよ。", "zh": "虽然不能什么都以自己为标准来想……不过，朋花\n一定相信，只要是ROCO和亚利沙就能做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1058_p", "source_sha256": "061c9e109016e082aad765952f20783cae106e336003030d8443a70a965ec190", "ja": "もちろん、俺もな！", "zh": "当然，我也一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1059_014mir", "source_sha256": "020b6abd5d083d2272395fe850e96287d34b308eaeee4caff75d2d7b3d3310c3", "ja": "{$P$}さん……私……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1060_014mir", "source_sha256": "0b02146ac407421a6c435be56390f9fa4aef95d068908be0d56a61d07619189e", "ja": "私、朋花ちゃんに謝ってきます！\nまだ、劇場にいるかもしれないから！", "zh": "我要去向朋花道歉！\n她可能还在剧场里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1061_p", "source_sha256": "c6c2b7a062121467ef379fc8fc6883770c450f1c861db3660ce6cb460fda0a40", "ja": "いいけど、走るなよ！", "zh": "去是可以，但别用跑的啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1062_014mir", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1063_se", "source_sha256": "a2da21ec920793a39b749f4ccfee4944d4d3c67adc4ba549591f650587686bbc", "ja": "バタバタ……バタン！", "zh": "手忙脚乱……砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1064_p", "source_sha256": "26533216cfbdd5ba3b945ff1666cea9d448b090c75016c8485d440d7633c1fec", "ja": "走るなって言ったのに……\nまあ、仕方がないか。", "zh": "都说了别跑……唉，也没办法了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1065_010azu", "source_sha256": "bf9b0f8b1687450e11285744a4deeb867eb532272ce087438e58c1f4c18112c5", "ja": "ふふっ。……{$P$}さん。\n未来ちゃんは、不思議な子ですね。", "zh": "呵呵……{$P$}先生。未来是个不可思议的孩子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1066_p", "source_sha256": "012efa012f5afc2181c0c129e5fd03654b109fdf3acd9d0b9932b73f859bf323", "ja": "不思議ですか？", "zh": "是很不可思议吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1067_010azu", "source_sha256": "38f7d741ca33ad79bbf9db790c931f48a9755ceb1f8cc487636303dde9d2d312", "ja": "ええ。アイドルとしては、決して\n順風満帆……というわけではないでしょう？", "zh": "是的。作为偶像，也并不是一直都一帆风顺……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1068_p", "source_sha256": "f16df1019227b03c787d28bae61db15f4ce0e67fc5b76b8d85d606daa7cebfbf", "ja": "そうですね。さっき本人も言っていましたけど……\nここのところ、オーディションも落ち続けていますし。", "zh": "是啊。正如她刚才自己说的……\n最近试镜也一直没通过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1069_010azu", "source_sha256": "21abd7773efc9493864d09bc5b1fe1a49b5726c85ca2073fa5f8ab9fcf4c5617", "ja": "でも、そうやって何度転んでも、\nまた立ち上がって走っていく……。", "zh": "可是，无论跌倒多少次，\n她都会再次站起来继续奔跑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1070_010azu", "source_sha256": "04aa1e98ef5b8f73d66d4e3235871bc21a7baae5dda210c602217506d7014fef", "ja": "その背中を見ていると、\nなんだか追いかけてしまいたくなるんです。", "zh": "看着那道背影，总觉得不知不觉就想追上去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1071_010azu", "source_sha256": "875d0aca5ba8af59ca89059af5fe1e326e79d576dae39e6d7015f3f40c25f8f8", "ja": "私も、未来ちゃんに負けないように走らなくちゃ、\nって気持ちにさせられてしまって。", "zh": "也让我不禁觉得，自己也得跑起来，不能输给未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1072_010azu", "source_sha256": "7b3cd0a3ddb98548d0331e67387802b14566b21dfb400383e1e217e7663e140a", "ja": "それって、とっても\n『アイドル』……なんじゃないでしょうか。", "zh": "那不就是非常有“偶像”风范吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1073_p", "source_sha256": "ef8fd9459a4d28bb4dae641e3fb8023aba072ec09e7d02a92f19307cd30500a4", "ja": "そうですね。未来は、\nすごくアイドルだと思います。色々な意味で。", "zh": "是啊。我觉得未来非常有偶像的感觉。从各种意义上来说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1074_p", "source_sha256": "1f66b376f5141f7cca71891e191b179538e4749cdad5cc119b98cf6ba84de9b5", "ja": "でも……本人がそれに気づくのは、\nまだまだ先かもしれませんね。", "zh": "不过……她本人要意识到这一点，或许还要过很久呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1075_014mir", "source_sha256": "f6568f54fd3c310af94fdbe3a17e20322e9d3bfe3a872621b768438e44919927", "ja": "控え室にもいない……\n朋花ちゃん、もう帰っちゃったかな……。", "zh": "休息室里也没有……\n朋花，是不是已经回去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1076_028ari", "source_sha256": "546523324e4b191159466238693f16ea9d1e286f40300d89246efdaf3ff82cb4", "ja": "あっ、未来ちゃん！", "zh": "啊，未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1077_014mir", "source_sha256": "a46af0edf3e32b10f1e8ea6e0536d52c4fd237b99b230261049612b13dc9a3bc", "ja": "あれ、ありさちゃんとロコちゃん？\nふたりとも、まだ帰ってなかったの？", "zh": "咦，亚利沙和ROCO？\n你们两个还没回去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1078_025roc", "source_sha256": "0f7fa5adea116aee53fc068e1db6e4e7615168efc3ccc4dfed4cc5c59b0b7aea", "ja": "なんだか気になって……\nミライこそ、まだ残ってたんですね。", "zh": "总觉得有点在意……\n未来才是，还没回去呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1079_014mir", "source_sha256": "4dc828ab7826f74a469760d2b6b3cc123785694f63c825341f2295fbcfdb91fa", "ja": "うん……あれ？　レッスンルームに誰かいる？\n……あっ！", "zh": "嗯……咦？练习室里有人？\n……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1080_031tom", "source_sha256": "ddbd222ff656a646b1a9398bdc254bdeb9bc130de45796e9fc347fa924cfdacb", "ja": "ええと……ここで止まって、次は……。", "zh": "呃……停在这里，然后接下来是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1081_014mir", "source_sha256": "8765c5c07fc9bdaa7e8f328433b45b95d757b1ebd4958b5a668f5557da80b60b", "ja": "とっ、朋花ちゃん！", "zh": "朋、朋花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1082_031tom", "source_sha256": "4c15f69d15e5548ac0b3fa990cde0aac1ff4e475d2062835a538830a65d81457", "ja": "？　……未来ちゃん？　亜利沙さん、ロコちゃんも。\nまだ帰っていなかったんですか～？", "zh": "？……未来？亚利沙，还有ROCO。\n你们还没回去吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1083_014mir", "source_sha256": "e3a4de978fe1ca4159162a744051e86912200a3f6116e0a73f251549635fbe84", "ja": "朋花ちゃんこそ……\nレッスンはとっくに終わったのに、何してるの？", "zh": "朋花你才是……\n课早就结束了，你在干什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1084_031tom", "source_sha256": "52a4e11226744ecd6abd2fba1655131e7da0e4ba985ea4d5d0573373c77d0467", "ja": "私は、居残りですよ～。今日やったところ、\n一番踊れていなかったのは、私ですから～。", "zh": "我留下来加练哦～。因为今天练的内容里，跳得最不好的人就是我～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1085_031tom", "source_sha256": "3aec1d11fc57be30955b1b706fd1d80259894663642c0eae200a96a438f43d0f", "ja": "できていないなら、できるまで練習する……\nアイドルとして、当然のことでは～？", "zh": "没做到的话，就练习到做到为止……\n作为偶像，这不是理所当然的吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1086_014mir", "source_sha256": "fa621238ab0671855d545737671c9b1d559010d0eea99896105f16de480c8a09", "ja": "そ、それは、そうかもしれないけど……。\nえっと……と、朋花ちゃん！", "zh": "这、这个嘛，或许是这样没错……  \n那个……朋、朋花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1087_031tom", "source_sha256": "225eebcffb56ab9fee6556296c530b5ea429d4d50c60a8b6a1a23cfa72d9882f", "ja": "なんでしょう～？", "zh": "什么事呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1088_014mir", "source_sha256": "f82be24e938fb5cc90c71a7d3b4864a24eeddfce7dab97f72fc5fae801f0388e", "ja": "私、朋花ちゃんに「手加減」って言われて、\nなんのことか、すぐにはわからなかった。けど……。", "zh": "我被朋花说了句\"手下留情\"，\n一开始完全不明白是什么意思。但是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1089_014mir", "source_sha256": "fcd5671b775231319e98b8a48bdd47343ee03d9f7aa32679640ba97e65c060e8", "ja": "頑張る前から諦めるなんて、すごく、すーっごく\n言っちゃダメなことだった！", "zh": "在努力之前就放弃，真的是、真的真的不能说出口的话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1090_014mir", "source_sha256": "ee3801a0adae15323b4bf9ac86146e38138018aebcabb96dbe22e240c448ee9b", "ja": "私、朋花ちゃんに……ありさちゃんとロコちゃんにも、\n失礼だったと思う！　ごめんなさい！", "zh": "我对朋花……还有亚利沙和ROCO，\n觉得自己太失礼了！对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1091_025roc", "source_sha256": "81fd81be6e7763e4da673759cc12979f235b90fe5dadb8d35bd0ea9fc6b9e35c", "ja": "ミライ……。", "zh": "未来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1092_031tom", "source_sha256": "5e92c4bded5ee9b2f761f368741aa86f30dc0e2736c00beeb670128cd4d4b4ae", "ja": "……未来ちゃん。ファンの子豚ちゃんたちは、\nアイドルに、何を求めていると思いますか～？", "zh": "……未来妹妹。你觉得粉丝的小猪崽们，\n都在向偶像寻求什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1093_014mir", "source_sha256": "486ef4ac29345adfa1dd93b52b8108438eeaf2916ec3ec04e5449b46e300d4d6", "ja": "え！？　あ、アイドルのファンが、アイドルに？\nえっと、えっと～……？", "zh": "诶！？那、那个，偶像的粉丝们会对偶像有什么期待呢？\n呃，呃～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1094_028ari", "source_sha256": "28c9efba2e1c8d0b9dd915955527a1b1eba85b95af4b333bbbc224bda0a7b403", "ja": "それはもちろん、存在そのものが……！", "zh": "那当然是，存在本身就是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1095_031tom", "source_sha256": "1cf1acdacafdc56338ab9f1e78ab46666017dede1c1f48bdf7f238b3c923efe4", "ja": "亜利沙さんは、黙っていてくださいね～。", "zh": "亚利沙小姐，请安静一会儿哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1096_028ari", "source_sha256": "ab609ce594e2054885617a91ba21b89f502de1a7dba22a848d6b8b2023520025", "ja": "ハイ。", "zh": "好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1097_031tom", "source_sha256": "e52acfad9c556b82fe8d57ec1f47b256dcc581d24af593c175e27d2e8d60dec9", "ja": "そうですね……では、ファンや子豚ちゃんではなく、\nファンになる前の、『お客さん』と呼びましょうか～。", "zh": "是这样呢……那么，比起称呼为粉丝或小猪崽，就叫作成为粉丝之前的“客人”吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1098_031tom", "source_sha256": "16e66e42a2b24d88dd80b93cdfa3b4c022e239803286b9ea23f87e9f482c0e26", "ja": "お客さんは、決して、アイドルなら何でもいい……\nというわけではありません～。", "zh": "客人们绝不是觉得只要是偶像就可以……并不是这样哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1099_031tom", "source_sha256": "51e8ec5bf5eacd67f5aa903c8e4367ce241d663b26db996c673592c652285171", "ja": "「この人は、推す価値があるかどうか」……。", "zh": "“这个人到底值不值得自己去支持”……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1100_031tom", "source_sha256": "226463bd68ca8195d464dbe2c66cde440ba485464952f738ce74e32520261f10", "ja": "私たちアイドルは、常にその視線に晒され、\n判断され続けているんですよ～。", "zh": "我们这些偶像，时时刻刻都暴露在那样的目光之下，不断地被人评判呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1101_025roc", "source_sha256": "83cfae06b7a485e353a37c76f511ef3641818f1fb8fb36f98284abf48bd359a7", "ja": "それは……そういう面もあると思います！\nでも、フィーリングやセンスの部分だって……！", "zh": "那……我觉得确实也有这一面！\n但是，感觉和品味方面也……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1102_031tom", "source_sha256": "e8c94b901e49051f88739e6418f542b66181c435cee65c33d24ca362681b9333", "ja": "もちろんです～。\n楽しいから、かわいいから、好きだから……。", "zh": "当然啦～  \n因为开心，因为可爱，因为喜欢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1103_031tom", "source_sha256": "4a7fbc564049a2c110850654eae776456f44a269e3d37467b6909716e170ae7e", "ja": "「誰かの目に晒され批評される」……アーティストの\nロコちゃんなら、たくさん経験していますよね～？", "zh": "“被人注视并评头品足”……作为艺术家的ROCO，肯定经历过很多次了吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1104_025roc", "source_sha256": "2f162d1ff3e20b7f5e54a51a51a496796067a3ffa4c03658a4b80ef192d349a8", "ja": "うっ……。", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1105_031tom", "source_sha256": "cf3035c319aa2e2d464ac55589b945948252a953b8f8a530213e4153dab1b872", "ja": "アイドルである以上、私たちは、歩みを止めることも、\n立ち止まることも、してはいけないんですよ～。", "zh": "既然身为偶像，我们就不能停下脚步，\n也不能止步不前哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1106_031tom", "source_sha256": "1de1cda072b6b15ef465c166eb424f67f3910c6abd9771d68b023dcc1a1161ab", "ja": "だから……それが苦しい人は、アイドルを\n続けられないのかもしれませんね～。", "zh": "所以……对觉得那很辛苦的人来说，或许就没法继续当偶像了吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1108_031tom", "source_sha256": "80d90f44087b42e0a2cc9c1031bacb27289b7d7d3bd950f6730dabc69e3500c2", "ja": "優しい未来ちゃんには、無理かもしれませんね～？", "zh": "对于温柔的未来来说，或许有点勉强吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1109_014mir", "source_sha256": "d928a5ef375f6964fd6b3f73c3c040b1f40a4feae9ae172708b9db2d94b94f15", "ja": "そ……そんなこと、ないもんっ！", "zh": "才……才不是那样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1110_014mir", "source_sha256": "9b4f824ea03c81c69c83eead809216f6dbaa7b46c9459a418b85b8b49442024c", "ja": "私、個性的じゃないし、オーディション落ちて\nばっかりだし。今は、何もできないけど……。", "zh": "我……我又没什么特色，试镜也老是落选。虽然现在什么都做不到，但是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1112_014mir", "source_sha256": "d577bac1d1d2facd10c467b296682505cf3443db6c70952ae610889172d882e5", "ja": "今はできなくても、いつか……\n何でもできる、すごいアイドルになるっ！", "zh": "即使现在还做不到，总有一天……\n我一定会成为无所不能的厉害偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1113_014mir", "source_sha256": "d0e3fe59a2aabd5db94e01ab6aee9af8357dbdad75cd6c5cced5a5a1415cca0f", "ja": "絶対絶対、ぜーったい、負けないからっ！", "zh": "我绝对绝对，绝——对不会输的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1114_031tom", "source_sha256": "caa6460dd46405def3b538fba4cd07ab69f1f5c79be7224b7710ac5b8a4a993f", "ja": "……うふふ。\nそう言うと思ってましたよ～。", "zh": "……呵呵。\n我就知道你会这么说呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1115_031tom", "source_sha256": "4fa951d30e8c3b85a38c1708bd327bf11f40bbb8881424e0b134a59de2a8e588", "ja": "優しすぎるのが、未来ちゃんの弱点ですが……\nその気持ちを忘れなければ、大丈夫かもしれませんね。", "zh": "太过温柔是未来的弱点，不过……只要不忘记那份心意，或许就没问题了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1116_014mir", "source_sha256": "66a03139372d7bb3f393c846138ec60d59bbf3a2ba5107ce484f09381bec403c", "ja": "朋花ちゃん……。", "zh": "朋花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1117_se", "source_sha256": "11a3eff6ddcb2f9220c563a84912c256013cf61509de1542cfda57effe297faa", "ja": "ガチャ、バタン", "zh": "咔嚓、砰", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1118_028ari", "source_sha256": "e37d5dcac40b425a2e5dc08635b33be54803f3a297a787922d81c0b0826e585d", "ja": "あっ……あずささん！\n{$P$}さんも！", "zh": "啊……梓小姐！\n{$P$}先生也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1119_010azu", "source_sha256": "80b088fb526109b62d48ffaf35a4dad01f2e3b7b886d43f45c1836e8df7ae1af", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま～。", "zh": "大家，辛苦啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1120_p", "source_sha256": "aa40ffa1bd80df1f3be40819ce1893642a9cb3e501571da0d9f87227c6374fb5", "ja": "お疲れさま。実は、あずささんの仕事が予定より\n早く終わってな。少し練習したいそうなんだ。", "zh": "辛苦了。其实，梓小姐的工作比预定时间提早结束了。她好像想练习一会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1121_p", "source_sha256": "c9e43f47347728324796c29b1e5706ae27d9c99d69b949c0b6b0d1235b9ba705", "ja": "朋花、一緒に練習させてもらってもいいか？", "zh": "朋花，可以让我们一起练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1122_031tom", "source_sha256": "ca6ad98f815fdf6c89aad96ac173890a5865a4ccf794ef3133cf71c3300eac57", "ja": "ええ、もちろんです～。", "zh": "嗯，当然可以呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1123_014mir", "source_sha256": "da2bc1dbc251e3edbefcd672d96199a4d31c76a9b45f71ac4df3f0e245228cea", "ja": "わ、私も！　私も練習したい！\nいいよね、朋花ちゃん！", "zh": "我、我也是！我也想练习！\n可以吧，朋花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_116_1124_p", "source_sha256": "443673c89a92f41d9a2380ad8f6aa16a23ea14286a49137e07613dfa61413ee7", "ja": "あ、その前に……未来に、話があるんだ。\n今度の公演で……。", "zh": "啊，在那之前……我有件事要跟未来说。\n关于下次的公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
